The rack of the fuel injection pump is stuck. Due to poor assembly or rack bending deformation and other reasons, the rack of the fuel injection pump is stuck, the plunger of the fuel injection pump can not rotate, so that the oil supply can not stop, leading to the diesel engine can not be flamed.
If the pump rack is bent and deformed, it can be straightened by knocking on the platform, but the surface shall not be damaged. If the rack and gear meshing is not good, the small file can be used for local correction; If it is due to improper assembly of parts, it should be corrected.
The handle on the rack of the diesel engine fuel injection pump is welded up. Because of the weak welding or excessive stress, it will make the throttle control handle can not pull the rack of the fuel injection pump to move, and can not make the fuel injection pump change the amount of oil, resulting in the diesel engine can not flame out.
At this time, the rack of the fuel injection pump should be replaced or the handle should be welded again. But the repair or replacement of the fuel injection pump rack must be able to mesh well with the adjusting gear, and the activity is flexible.
